{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"issues\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"screen\": \"像熟人安静坐着 偶尔对视也不尴尬\",\n      \"source\": \"也像相识已久的人安静坐着，不必拼命找话题；对方偶尔望来一眼，沉默也不让人紧张。\",\n      \"type\": \"5\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿写的是对方单方面偶尔望来一眼，屏幕稿改成双方对视，增加了互相注视这一动作。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"screen\": \"几次柔软的落音像一根温柔的刺：眼前的好还在，心里却先有一点鼻酸（到时出现） / 歌声忽然往上涌了一次；接着又轻轻呼出一口气，回到柔和，没有把心事彻底说死（到时出现）\",\n      \"source\": \"到第12–14小节，先前小心收着的歌声忽然往上涌了一次……第14–16小节，它没有继续冲向高潮，而像轻轻呼出一口气，重新回到柔和。声音短暂落稳，又漂起来一点，没有把心事彻底说死。几次柔软的落音，像一根温柔的刺。\",\n      \"type\": \"7\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿先写歌声上涌、回柔，再写柔软落音带来的鼻酸；屏幕稿把落音的感受提前，调换了两段音乐感受的呈现顺序。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "64db69f0-12ea-4ade-9289-32395050fc41", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T053415561380Z", "elapsed_seconds": 338.469, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T05:39:54.047233+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fe2c9b3cddef3b6562260f7057c7239dcf3276df7da8e1c8faa0d4593cb15721", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_c